put('supplementary/S_Methods_EN.md',f'''# Supplementary methods notes (for author editing)

**Frozen software and inputs.** New primary experiments used CellChat 2.2.0.9001, final ESS 0.2.2 and AutoZyme 0.3.1 where applicable, with source commits and binary hashes in the build map. Prepared objects and LR/database contents were held fixed across methods; use of the new CellChat package does not imply native preprocessing with a new CellChatDB. Historical CC1.6.1/ESS0.1.1 records are separate.

**Timing.** A fresh R process was used per method. External elapsed-time measurement spanned the full inference-function call, including its conversion/initialization, and excluded process startup, package/input loading, result serialization and downstream summarization. GNU time measured the full process and peak RSS. All methods used one internal thread, triMean, raw.use=TRUE, population.size=FALSE, nboot=100, seed.use=1, Kh=0.5 and n=1. Default aggregate count comparisons used probability>0 and p<0.05; no minimum-cell filter was silently added.

**Design and uncertainty.** The primary design contained 12 datasets ×6target sizes ×3prepared replicates (216pairs), representing129unique inputs. For33dataset–scale combinations, full inputs were re-timed (99records); they are not99independent biological inputs. Downsampling seeds and full-object reuse are recorded per row in S_A2_prepared_input_seeds.tsv and the input-hash manifests. These inputs were reused unchanged; no new downsampling was performed. Primary pair order alternated Original/ESS and ESS/Original; at most8pairs ran concurrently. Three-method comparisons used32inputs and all6method orders per input (192blocks), at most4inputs concurrently, methods serial within each block. These execution choices may influence wall-time variability. Ablation and Xenium ran serially after the timing queues.

For primary confidence intervals,12datasets were sampled with replacement10,000times (NumPy PCG64,seed20261026). All records of each selected dataset were included with cluster multiplicity. The pooled statistic was the median of all selected paired ratios. A separate statistic was the median of the12dataset-specific medians. The2.5th/97.5th empirical percentiles defined each95%CI. The AutoZyme analysis used100,000resamples,seed20261027, and the same two distinct statistics. For sensitivity analysis, paired ratios were first reduced to one median per(dataset,inputSHA256); the129input-level records were then cluster-bootstrapped in the same way. Neither statistic is a ratio of independent method-time medians.

**Support-set features.** For LR interaction l, A_l={{(s,r):L_l(s)>0 and R_adj_l(r)>0}}, using the globally normalized signaling expression, triMean group summaries, complex definitions and co-receptor adjustment from the held-fixed object. f_LR=sum_l|A_l|/(nLR*K^2); f_union=|union_l A_l|/K^2. Both use the preprocessed eligible LR set and exclude downstream significance/minimum-cell filtering. In all216new inputs, this strict support set and the set of observed nonzero probabilities were elementwise equal; script outputs record both mismatch directions. Signaling sparsity is1-nnz/(signalinggenes*cells), and object bytes are R object.size(data.signaling), not process RSS. Group-size minimum/median/maximum are reported per object.

For nonnegative finite expression, a zero required ligand or adjusted receptor makes the nonnegative LR product zero; its Hill factor is zero, and finite modifier factors cannot restore it. Original CellChat explicitly sets p=1 where the observed probability is zero, even when a permuted probability could be nonzero. ESS therefore skips those bootstrap computations while retaining p=1. This reasoning relies on the declared supported model/input restrictions and the original override, not on assuming every bootstrap probability is zero. The strict P_boot>P_obs comparison is unchanged. Single effective genes return their group summary directly; multigene complexes retain the geometric mean. Structure tests and guards bound the verified coverage.

**Resource and trace scope.** Actual Xenium target traces retain all cells/groups, the original normalization anchor and permutation sequence, but trace four LR rows/five target entries only (500decisions perCellChatversion). The full627LR ESS profile is independent resource evidence, not a full Original numerical comparison. Dense outputs each require O(nLR*K^2) doubles. RSS stages indicate when process memory rises and cannot exactly attribute object-level allocations; payload bytes and peakRSS are different quantities. Sampling interval/gaps, C++ completion and R function return are recorded separately.
''')
put('supplementary/S_Methods_CN.md',f'''# 补充方法材料（供作者本地组织）

新核心使用固定源码CC2.2.0.9001/ESS0.2.2/AZ0.3.1。prepared对象及数据库/LR内容在方法间一致；不是声称重新采用新版数据库预处理。历史CC1.6.1/ESS0.1.1独立保留。

每方法fresh R进程；推断外部计时覆盖完整调用及函数内部转换/初始化，不含进程启动、包/输入加载、保存和下游分析。GNU time另记录整进程墙钟和peakRSS。统一单线程、triMean、raw.useTRUE、population.sizeFALSE、nboot100、seed.use1、Kh0.5、n1。count默认prob>0且p<.05后聚合，无最小细胞数过滤。

216配对为12数据集×6目标规模×3重复，129不同SHA256输入；33数据集–规模组合/99条记录是完整输入重复计时。下采样种子与完整输入复用按配置/哈希逐条记录。新版Original/ESS方法顺序交替，最多8对并发；192区组覆盖六种方法顺序，最多4输入并发、区组内方法顺序串行。消融与Xenium在队列后串行。并发和时序会影响计时波动。

主分析以数据集为cluster重抽12次、共10000次bootstrap，PCG64 seed20261026；每次保留抽中数据集内全部记录和重复抽中次数，以所有配对比值中位数为pooled统计量。另算12数据集中位数的中位数。CI为2.5/97.5百分位。AZ分析100000次、seed20261027，两个统计量不混用。去重先对每(dataset,inputSHA)的配对比值取中位数，再对129输入聚类bootstrap，不以独立方法耗时中位数相除。

A_l={{(s,r):L_l(s)>0且R_adj_l(r)>0}}；f_LR=sum|A_l|/(nLR*K²)，f_union=|并集A_l|/K²。均基于已预处理LR集合，不含下游显著性或最小细胞数过滤。全部216输入严格支持集与观测非零概率集合逐元素相同，两方向差异均记录为0。稀疏度为信号子矩阵1-nnz/(gene*cells)；object.size和RSS分别报告；每对象群大小min/median/max见表。

剪枝论证：在所支持的非负有限输入和模型中，必要配体或调整后受体为0令LR乘积/Hill项为0；有限修饰因子不能恢复非零概率。原始CellChat对观测P=0强制p=1，即使某些置换P_boot非零。ESS跳过这些置换计算仍保留p=1。严格P_boot>P_obs不变。单个有效基因直接用汇总值，多亚基仍几何平均。适用输入限制见SUPPORTED_WORKFLOWS，结构和守卫仅界定实际测试范围。

Xenium真实追踪保持全细胞/分组/归一化与置换，只覆盖4LR/5目标、每版本500判定；不能声称全627LR与Original完全一致。全量627LR独立ESS资源剖析每输出仍O(nLR*K²)，RSS阶段仅定位增长发生时间，不精确分配每对象责任。输出载荷/对象大小/peakRSS分开，采样间隔和缺口如实列明。
''')
